WEBVTT

00:00:00.274 --> 00:00:03.174
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:00:03.574 --> 00:00:06.444
Maji de ii kanji

00:00:06.814 --> 00:00:09.574
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:00:10.014 --> 00:00:13.184
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:16.224
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:17.394
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:00:17.394 --> 00:00:18.654
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:00:18.654 --> 00:00:20.324
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:20.324 --> 00:00:21.354
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:00:21.524 --> 00:00:24.834
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:27.264
Kokoro no limiter

00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:30.694
Tokihanatareta hora

00:00:31.104 --> 00:00:34.304
Yes! Change the world!

00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:37.404
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:00:37.714 --> 00:00:41.014
Real wo tsuranuite

00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:44.254
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:00:44.254 --> 00:00:47.184
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:00:48.324 --> 00:00:54.794
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:00:54.794 --> 00:01:00.734
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:01:01.164 --> 00:01:07.564
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:01:07.774 --> 00:01:12.314
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:01:12.314 --> 00:01:16.404
We can try over the future world!

00:01:16.654 --> 00:01:17.014
Yeah!

00:01:17.754 --> 00:01:18.414
Saidai!

00:01:20.554 --> 00:01:21.784
Daitan!

00:01:31.164 --> 00:01:34.104
I have to go! I have to save Minamoto, at once!

00:01:35.104 --> 00:01:36.004
But!

00:01:36.004 --> 00:01:37.564
Then we're coming, too.

00:01:38.104 --> 00:01:39.644
Aoi! Shiho!

00:01:39.644 --> 00:01:40.544
You two.

00:01:40.544 --> 00:01:42.234
Why did you come back?

00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:45.344
Why else? An esper hunch.

00:01:45.344 --> 00:01:47.344
We can sense immediately
if one of us is in a jam!

00:01:47.344 --> 00:01:48.784
Which is a total lie.

00:01:51.514 --> 00:01:54.314
Mr. Minamoto washed my underpants?!

00:01:57.254 --> 00:02:00.564
My father just had some unexpected
work, so I came home.

00:02:00.564 --> 00:02:02.964
No one will ever marry me now...

00:02:02.964 --> 00:02:04.084
You're exaggerating.

00:02:04.294 --> 00:02:06.994
Anyway, since they were nice
enough to leave a map...

00:02:07.304 --> 00:02:09.774
Let's go after them! I need
to tell Mr. Minamoto

00:02:09.774 --> 00:02:11.774
he shouldn't go washing a lady's underpants!

00:02:11.774 --> 00:02:14.074
All right! Now that that's settled, let's go!

00:02:14.074 --> 00:02:14.734
Yeah!

00:02:15.074 --> 00:02:17.564
Hey! Oh, man...

00:02:19.014 --> 00:02:21.504
24th sense.
"Stay At Home Dad! Cleaned!"

00:02:27.884 --> 00:02:30.154
Do you work for Hyobu?

00:02:33.924 --> 00:02:35.864
Did he order this?

00:02:37.894 --> 00:02:38.554
Well?!

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:43.234
What an annoying old guy!
Shut up, or I'll gag you!

00:02:43.804 --> 00:02:47.104
It pisses me off that a weakling
like her gets to be queen!

00:02:47.204 --> 00:02:50.174
How dare a girl like that try and steal my major!

00:02:50.174 --> 00:02:52.074
"My major"?!

00:02:52.074 --> 00:02:55.484
Do you know what you're saying?

00:02:55.484 --> 00:02:57.744
Wake up! That perverted old man is...

00:02:58.184 --> 00:03:00.654
Badmouth the major again and
I'll tape your nose up, too!

00:03:01.484 --> 00:03:04.254
Well, the part about him being
a pervert is true, so...

00:03:04.954 --> 00:03:06.114
Also...

00:03:08.524 --> 00:03:10.234
I'll be keeping this.

00:03:10.234 --> 00:03:12.264
So that you don't do anything stupid.

00:03:12.264 --> 00:03:16.104
I'm warning you, if you try and
run or call your friends...

00:03:16.534 --> 00:03:18.434
you're dead.

00:03:20.704 --> 00:03:23.104
Who are these guys?

00:03:24.714 --> 00:03:28.544
Darn it, where are they?!

00:03:28.544 --> 00:03:30.144
Hey! Rest a bit!

00:03:30.654 --> 00:03:32.114
But Minamoto, is!

00:03:32.214 --> 00:03:36.354
Even if those shoes were made for your
powers, they have their limits!

00:03:36.354 --> 00:03:37.124
But!

00:03:37.124 --> 00:03:39.214
Don't waste your strength!

00:03:41.024 --> 00:03:43.194
Bus Stop
HIGASHICHOU

00:03:43.194 --> 00:03:43.434
To town Here River
Mountain Bunnies live here! Bridge

00:03:43.434 --> 00:03:46.164
To town Here River
Mountain Bunnies live here! Bridge
Anyway, this map really stinks.

00:03:46.164 --> 00:03:48.204
To town Here River
Mountain Bunnies live here! Bridge
The mark for this bus stop
looks like the one for oden.

00:03:49.104 --> 00:03:54.244
Is she stupid? It's all misspelled
and sloppy. How do we read this?!

00:03:54.244 --> 00:03:56.004
Here, let me see it.

00:04:02.884 --> 00:04:05.784
You must be tired. You haven't slept all night.

00:04:06.354 --> 00:04:08.624
It... It's nothing!

00:04:08.624 --> 00:04:09.224
Right!

00:04:09.224 --> 00:04:11.654
Anyway, Dr. Sakaki, can you see anything?

00:04:13.794 --> 00:04:16.664
I see. About 20 km south of here.

00:04:16.664 --> 00:04:19.894
Pretty deep in the mountains. In that case...

00:04:21.264 --> 00:04:23.104
My powers aren't working well right now.

00:04:23.104 --> 00:04:25.234
This'll take some time, so why
don't you take a nap?

00:04:26.174 --> 00:04:27.444
Sure, okay.

00:04:27.444 --> 00:04:28.494
Roger.

00:04:47.964 --> 00:04:51.834
Minamoto wouldn't want you girls to fight.

00:04:51.834 --> 00:04:53.454
I'll handle the dirty work.

00:04:56.804 --> 00:04:58.734
Elementary school. Keep out!

00:05:03.314 --> 00:05:06.674
It looks like an abandoned
school somewhere. But...

00:05:08.484 --> 00:05:10.914
Is she living here?

00:05:18.294 --> 00:05:20.554
She hasn't come yet, has she?

00:05:20.964 --> 00:05:23.364
The Children come home tonight.

00:05:23.364 --> 00:05:27.094
They won't read your message
or contact you till then.

00:05:29.404 --> 00:05:32.934
Fine. I'll just beat her up
as soon as she gets here.

00:05:37.214 --> 00:05:39.714
Which do you want? For breakfast.

00:05:39.714 --> 00:05:41.574
Do you want miso or curry-flavored?

00:05:42.484 --> 00:05:45.914
Don't tell me you eat these for all three meals!

00:05:47.854 --> 00:05:49.824
What about it?!

00:05:51.894 --> 00:05:54.364
First come vegetables. Eat your vegetables!

00:05:54.364 --> 00:05:55.564
Why?

00:05:55.564 --> 00:05:58.584
To wash out all that excess salt and additives!

00:06:02.704 --> 00:06:04.174
It has no flavor!

00:06:04.274 --> 00:06:06.574
Your sense of taste is just too dull!

00:06:06.574 --> 00:06:09.244
It's from too many flavor
enhancers and additives!

00:06:09.244 --> 00:06:11.264
Learn what real food tastes like!

00:06:14.284 --> 00:06:16.044
We're home!

00:06:18.354 --> 00:06:19.884
Oh, good.

00:06:19.884 --> 00:06:23.374
That'll be for lunch and dinner, so
just set them down over there.

00:06:23.924 --> 00:06:26.444
Hey! Don't take the green onion out!

00:06:26.524 --> 00:06:28.114
Eat it all!

00:06:29.364 --> 00:06:33.324
Why are you so bossy?!
Don't you know what you are?

00:06:33.734 --> 00:06:36.494
A hostage, so I can't run away, right?

00:06:37.274 --> 00:06:39.974
Anyway, I'm not eating this.

00:06:39.974 --> 00:06:42.304
Sure, whatever you want.

00:06:42.974 --> 00:06:46.844
But will the major like some
stunted, unhealthy girl

00:06:46.844 --> 00:06:50.074
with dry hair and skin, riddled
with intestinal parasites,

00:06:50.214 --> 00:06:52.084
who always catches colds?

00:06:59.924 --> 00:07:01.554
Gotcha!

00:07:05.294 --> 00:07:07.464
Now that I'm up close, you aren't cute at all!

00:07:07.464 --> 00:07:10.364
Your hair and skin are dry,
and you smell bad, too.

00:07:11.234 --> 00:07:13.944
The height thing I don't mind,
me being a pervert and all,

00:07:13.944 --> 00:07:15.674
but the rest is too much!

00:07:17.774 --> 00:07:20.614
And so... Shall we go, my queen?

00:07:20.614 --> 00:07:21.584
Sure!

00:07:29.024 --> 00:07:30.654
Well? That's okay with you?

00:07:30.654 --> 00:07:32.884
No! Absolutely not!

00:07:33.424 --> 00:07:35.864
Anything else? Is there anything
else I need to improve?

00:07:36.394 --> 00:07:39.854
Tell me! Tell me everything, right now!

00:07:45.204 --> 00:07:48.234
Dammit, this has all gone wrong.

00:07:49.474 --> 00:07:51.964
I'll leave your clothes and a towel here for you.

00:07:52.444 --> 00:07:57.004
I can't believe a girl who doesn't even
have five days worth of clothes.

00:08:02.024 --> 00:08:04.554
And wash behind your ears, you hear me?!

00:08:04.554 --> 00:08:05.794
All right!

00:08:05.794 --> 00:08:07.284
Good. Later.

00:08:08.694 --> 00:08:10.934
Is that guy really a man?

00:08:10.934 --> 00:08:12.454
He's more like a middle-aged lady.

00:08:15.334 --> 00:08:17.304
Enough!

00:08:24.374 --> 00:08:25.914
It's soft.

00:08:25.914 --> 00:08:29.614
And... it smells nice, too.

00:08:35.324 --> 00:08:37.154
How peaceful.

00:08:37.154 --> 00:08:40.184
I can almost forget I'm a prisoner.

00:08:41.194 --> 00:08:42.784
No, I can't.

00:08:42.894 --> 00:08:46.794
Say, can I ask you some things?
How long has she been living here?

00:08:47.834 --> 00:08:50.304
Doesn't she have any family?

00:08:50.374 --> 00:08:53.104
Does she have any adults with her, besides you?

00:08:54.274 --> 00:08:57.834
I see. A lot must have happened to her.

00:09:06.584 --> 00:09:08.354
What are you doing, Minamoto?

00:09:08.354 --> 00:09:09.354
Sakaki?!

00:09:09.354 --> 00:09:11.624
Still playing house husband,
even with the enemy?

00:09:13.994 --> 00:09:16.594
Careful! We don't know what his power is!

00:09:16.594 --> 00:09:18.394
Don't worry.

00:09:30.014 --> 00:09:34.544
Surprised? This has been tuned
to synch with my power.

00:09:34.544 --> 00:09:37.274
I can see your powers and every
move you're going to make!

00:09:38.684 --> 00:09:40.584
Koremitsu Yamada! Former employee of

00:09:40.584 --> 00:09:43.454
a civilian security firm specializing
in conflict zones!

00:09:43.594 --> 00:09:45.554
In short, a mercenary!

00:09:45.554 --> 00:09:47.424
But after being wounded in combat...

00:09:47.424 --> 00:09:48.394
Shut up!

00:09:48.394 --> 00:09:49.224
A telepath?!

00:09:49.224 --> 00:09:52.994
Mad I found out your past, Hyobu's lap dog?!

00:09:56.374 --> 00:09:59.234
A telepath whose injuries cost
him his ability to receive.

00:09:59.234 --> 00:10:03.304
Hyobu's probably the only
one who'd take you on!

00:10:04.414 --> 00:10:07.774
The major is fighting for the future of all espers!

00:10:08.284 --> 00:10:13.084
Thanks to him, I can fight a
righteous battle like this!

00:10:14.924 --> 00:10:16.154
Righteous?

00:10:16.154 --> 00:10:17.694
Hyobu is righteous?!

00:10:17.694 --> 00:10:21.024
He's the worst esper criminal in history!

00:10:21.894 --> 00:10:23.264
He saved Mio.

00:10:23.464 --> 00:10:24.434
Mio?

00:10:24.434 --> 00:10:29.364
You must have figured it out.
The sort of environment she grew up in.

00:10:31.434 --> 00:10:35.804
She never made a single facial
expression till the major found her.

00:10:37.814 --> 00:10:43.754
To Normals, espers are just monsters.
Convenient monsters.

00:10:43.754 --> 00:10:48.824
The major started his organization
in order to save children like her.

00:10:48.824 --> 00:10:49.444
Organization?

00:10:49.954 --> 00:10:54.164
Yes! The revolutionary group
dedicated to esper liberation!

00:10:54.164 --> 00:10:55.354
PANDRA!

00:10:56.024 --> 00:10:57.234
PANDRA?!

00:10:57.234 --> 00:10:59.724
Then Kugutsu and Muscle are
members of PANDRA now?

00:11:00.464 --> 00:11:03.734
So, why don't you join us, too?

00:11:13.614 --> 00:11:15.014
My body is long.

00:11:19.454 --> 00:11:20.644
Together!

00:11:21.224 --> 00:11:24.624
I can ask the major to make
a special exception for you.

00:11:26.794 --> 00:11:28.524
What?

00:11:28.524 --> 00:11:30.014
Oh, nothing.

00:11:30.594 --> 00:11:32.924
"She's pretty, once she
changes her clothes, isn't she?"

00:11:33.434 --> 00:11:35.804
...is what he's saying in his mind.

00:11:35.804 --> 00:11:37.234
S-Shiho?

00:11:37.534 --> 00:11:40.274
Oh? Do I get the feeling we're interrupting?

00:11:40.274 --> 00:11:41.704
Aoi? Which means...

00:11:41.704 --> 00:11:43.574
I'm here, too, naturally!

00:11:43.574 --> 00:11:47.944
So, why so friendly with the girl
who called me out for a fight?!

00:11:49.084 --> 00:11:50.174
You're wrong!

00:11:51.384 --> 00:11:52.754
So, they came after all.

00:11:53.354 --> 00:11:54.984
Reflect on what you did!

00:11:55.084 --> 00:11:56.244
Queen...

00:11:57.024 --> 00:11:59.324
I figured you'd bring your friends along!

00:11:59.324 --> 00:12:01.384
Then what I'll do...

00:12:03.234 --> 00:12:04.564
is take you all down!

00:12:05.694 --> 00:12:06.594
She's split!

00:12:07.534 --> 00:12:09.464
So, who do I take down first?

00:12:11.204 --> 00:12:13.274
Minamoto, release our limiters!

00:12:13.274 --> 00:12:14.434
Right! Gotcha!

00:12:15.374 --> 00:12:16.844
When did you take that?!

00:12:16.844 --> 00:12:17.974
Sorry.

00:12:17.974 --> 00:12:20.134
I took it back while you were bathing.

00:12:20.514 --> 00:12:23.184
Special espers The Children, released!

00:12:23.184 --> 00:12:24.084
<<RELEASED>>
Special espers The Children, released!

00:12:25.614 --> 00:12:29.584
If danger lies on the path of someone
you protect in your heart...

00:12:29.584 --> 00:12:33.164
You risk your own life to safe theirs!

00:12:33.164 --> 00:12:35.264
That is what people call espers!

00:12:35.264 --> 00:12:37.054
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:12:38.294 --> 00:12:39.394
Koremitsu,

00:12:39.394 --> 00:12:40.454
handle...

00:12:40.534 --> 00:12:41.694
the other two!

00:12:44.134 --> 00:12:45.604
Let's go!

00:12:49.504 --> 00:12:52.314
You think you can beat me at teleporting?

00:12:52.314 --> 00:12:53.644
I do.

00:12:54.144 --> 00:12:58.084
Since I can do sectional
teleportation... I'm on top!

00:12:58.554 --> 00:12:59.074
Ow!

00:13:00.624 --> 00:13:05.054
Relax, I didn't sever it.
It's still attached to your body.

00:13:05.054 --> 00:13:06.894
Gimme back my leg!

00:13:06.894 --> 00:13:09.364
Now, what to do?

00:13:13.704 --> 00:13:15.234
No! Stop it!

00:13:15.234 --> 00:13:16.034
Aoi!

00:13:19.004 --> 00:13:20.304
What's this?

00:13:20.304 --> 00:13:22.904
An esper, using something like this?

00:13:28.784 --> 00:13:31.684
There's some fuel left. The battery's usable, too.

00:13:34.984 --> 00:13:39.094
Hydraulic shovel. Maker: Oomatsu.
Model #PC120-5.

00:13:39.094 --> 00:13:41.664
Load capacity: 11,700 kg.

00:13:41.664 --> 00:13:44.294
Standard bucket capacity of 0.5 cubic meters.

00:13:44.294 --> 00:13:47.464
I breathe life into you!

00:14:01.284 --> 00:14:02.614
Better than I thought.

00:14:07.924 --> 00:14:09.444
Brute strength...

00:14:10.154 --> 00:14:11.824
isn't gonna beat me.

00:14:11.824 --> 00:14:13.194
You!

00:14:13.194 --> 00:14:15.064
Some queen.

00:14:15.064 --> 00:14:16.864
If you become queen...

00:14:16.864 --> 00:14:19.224
what more could you want?!

00:14:21.204 --> 00:14:24.724
What do I do?! What do I do?!
Which one should I be cheering for?!

00:14:24.804 --> 00:14:26.864
Whose side are you on?!

00:14:27.704 --> 00:14:28.834
Hibernation mode!

00:14:29.044 --> 00:14:30.604
Hey! You coward!

00:14:34.114 --> 00:14:37.744
I told you, I can anticipate his moves.

00:14:37.884 --> 00:14:41.284
It's just that my body can't keep up with them...

00:14:41.284 --> 00:14:41.384
HA HA HA HA HA
It's just that my body can't keep up with them...

00:14:41.384 --> 00:14:42.384
HA HA HA HA HA

00:14:42.384 --> 00:14:43.524
HA HA HA HA HA
Then it's meaningless!

00:14:44.094 --> 00:14:46.764
Still, this is nothing!

00:14:46.764 --> 00:14:49.394
Don't overexert yourself.
Your wounds still aren't healed.

00:14:49.394 --> 00:14:50.554
Don't you have enough to worry about?!

00:14:52.734 --> 00:14:53.854
Sakaki, look out!

00:14:54.404 --> 00:14:55.764
Minamoto!

00:15:01.204 --> 00:15:02.734
What the hell?!

00:15:04.174 --> 00:15:05.774
I have no choice.

00:15:05.774 --> 00:15:08.114
Dammit! You scanned me!

00:15:08.114 --> 00:15:10.174
What don't you have a choice about?!

00:15:10.254 --> 00:15:11.114
Sakaki!

00:15:13.284 --> 00:15:14.654
Someone like you!

00:15:15.524 --> 00:15:18.884
No, wait! What are you?! Stop!

00:15:18.994 --> 00:15:20.254
Come back here!

00:15:26.964 --> 00:15:28.864
Sakaki, take care of him!

00:15:28.934 --> 00:15:30.734
Don't wreck my bike!

00:15:31.174 --> 00:15:34.004
I can tell by the weight. More
than her torso is missing here.

00:15:36.544 --> 00:15:38.444
The shoe's on the other foot now!

00:15:38.444 --> 00:15:40.674
Now, taste my patented technique!

00:15:43.984 --> 00:15:46.114
Isozol Venous Injection!

00:15:46.114 --> 00:15:48.084
It's just an anesthetic!

00:15:49.684 --> 00:15:51.084
Technique, complete.

00:15:54.964 --> 00:15:55.584
You!

00:15:56.024 --> 00:15:57.054
You're finally back?

00:15:57.464 --> 00:15:59.394
You think you can get away?!

00:16:01.534 --> 00:16:02.664
Kaoru, you okay?

00:16:06.004 --> 00:16:08.774
Fine! I'll blow you both away!

00:16:08.774 --> 00:16:10.334
Why me, too?!

00:16:11.044 --> 00:16:12.114
Mr. Minamoto!

00:16:12.114 --> 00:16:12.844
Aoi?

00:16:12.844 --> 00:16:15.814
Something's wrong! She suddenly collapsed!

00:16:15.814 --> 00:16:18.514
And she's fading away!

00:16:19.054 --> 00:16:20.384
Dupe #1!

00:16:20.384 --> 00:16:21.354
I thought so.

00:16:21.454 --> 00:16:22.754
Wh-What do you mean?

00:16:22.754 --> 00:16:27.154
The strain of dividing yourself to fight
The Children was too much for you.

00:16:32.394 --> 00:16:33.194
Shiho!

00:16:37.804 --> 00:16:39.034
Her personality's out of control!

00:16:39.774 --> 00:16:43.234
If we don't do something, she'll absorb you, too!

00:16:43.844 --> 00:16:46.034
I don't need you!

00:16:46.574 --> 00:16:48.474
I'm the main body now!

00:16:48.914 --> 00:16:50.434
Oh, get real.

00:16:51.254 --> 00:16:52.614
Come back! Now!

00:16:52.914 --> 00:16:53.984
Fool!

00:16:53.984 --> 00:16:56.794
I already control two-thirds of us!

00:16:56.794 --> 00:16:58.414
You're the one who's going to vanish!

00:16:59.154 --> 00:16:59.964
Mio!

00:16:59.964 --> 00:17:01.594
It doesn't matter.

00:17:01.594 --> 00:17:04.524
You really want to disappear, don't you?

00:17:06.134 --> 00:17:08.934
You have no one to protect you!

00:17:08.934 --> 00:17:12.134
Even the major prefers the queen to you!

00:17:14.544 --> 00:17:19.774
Even if you defeated her,
you'll never have what she has!

00:17:19.774 --> 00:17:21.774
A home. Family. Friends.

00:17:23.414 --> 00:17:25.974
Or someone to love you!

00:17:27.884 --> 00:17:30.854
There's no place for you in this world!

00:17:31.354 --> 00:17:34.224
Mio, no! Be strong and hang on!

00:17:34.224 --> 00:17:38.064
It's no use! Because everything she says...

00:17:38.564 --> 00:17:40.154
It's all true!

00:17:40.264 --> 00:17:41.024
Mio.

00:17:45.034 --> 00:17:47.074
Don't I matter?

00:17:47.074 --> 00:17:50.574
Why? Because I have this power?

00:17:50.574 --> 00:17:52.474
Is my power bad?

00:17:53.014 --> 00:17:55.444
Why? Why am I special?

00:17:55.444 --> 00:17:56.504
Why?

00:17:57.954 --> 00:17:59.684
Kaoru.

00:18:01.124 --> 00:18:02.744
Come back.

00:18:28.744 --> 00:18:29.644
Come back!

00:18:33.624 --> 00:18:35.124
I said, come back!

00:18:35.124 --> 00:18:36.854
Even you aren't alone!

00:18:43.994 --> 00:18:45.054
Queen...

00:18:46.734 --> 00:18:49.204
Jeez, does Kaoru know what she's doing?

00:18:49.204 --> 00:18:51.604
She called you out here to beat you.

00:18:51.604 --> 00:18:53.104
I don't know why.

00:18:53.104 --> 00:18:56.204
Maybe I just hate to see an esper
so down in the dumps.

00:18:56.204 --> 00:18:58.644
So, at times like this...

00:18:58.644 --> 00:19:01.044
Somehow, a new power appears!

00:19:02.584 --> 00:19:04.414
PSYCHIC...

00:19:04.414 --> 00:19:05.404
She's fast!

00:19:08.754 --> 00:19:10.844
AFTERIMAGE HUNDRED CRACK FIST!

00:19:18.864 --> 00:19:19.794
Now!

00:19:23.504 --> 00:19:24.374
She did it!

00:19:24.374 --> 00:19:25.774
You're back in one piece!

00:19:25.774 --> 00:19:27.204
But...

00:19:28.044 --> 00:19:29.704
Hey, are you okay?

00:19:29.704 --> 00:19:31.214
Suddenly, she's all beat up.

00:19:31.214 --> 00:19:33.414
Splitting yourself is exhausting.

00:19:33.414 --> 00:19:34.744
Really?

00:19:37.854 --> 00:19:39.644
Thank goodness!

00:19:42.224 --> 00:19:44.244
Why are you acting like such a big shot?

00:19:44.854 --> 00:19:47.484
Someone like you... Like you!

00:19:49.164 --> 00:19:49.854
Mio.

00:19:56.234 --> 00:19:59.934
Next time! And even if the world turns
upside-down, I still say you're no queen!

00:20:00.004 --> 00:20:00.994
How'd she recover so fast?!

00:20:01.104 --> 00:20:03.304
Am I clear? The major is mine!

00:20:03.304 --> 00:20:05.174
I'll surpass you soon!

00:20:07.784 --> 00:20:10.544
Darn it! Come back here!

00:20:12.454 --> 00:20:14.824
Forget it. She's completely gone.

00:20:14.824 --> 00:20:16.724
Looks like she took the big guy, too.

00:20:16.724 --> 00:20:18.194
Oh, that pisses me off!

00:20:18.194 --> 00:20:19.924
Next time, I'm make her sorry!

00:20:19.924 --> 00:20:22.124
Shiho, any clues?

00:20:22.364 --> 00:20:23.634
Clues...

00:20:23.634 --> 00:20:24.184
What?!

00:20:24.934 --> 00:20:27.454
She was wearing underwear
that Mr. Minamoto washed.

00:20:34.704 --> 00:20:36.344
Man, I'm hungry!

00:20:36.344 --> 00:20:37.914
What should we have for dinner?

00:20:37.914 --> 00:20:40.604
I'd like miso soup and Manilla clams.

00:20:41.644 --> 00:20:44.654
You really had some bad luck, Minamoto.

00:20:44.654 --> 00:20:46.314
Luckily, you're okay.

00:20:46.314 --> 00:20:48.084
Man, those girls...

00:20:48.624 --> 00:20:50.524
You brought those injuries on yourself.

00:20:50.524 --> 00:20:53.654
Still, Hyobu is definitely up to something.

00:20:53.764 --> 00:20:56.464
The full story on PANDRA
and the meaning of "queen"...

00:20:56.464 --> 00:20:59.094
We need to figure those out, quickly.

00:20:59.094 --> 00:21:00.394
Yeah.

00:21:02.204 --> 00:21:04.934
Minamoto, what's wrong?

00:21:05.574 --> 00:21:09.064
If BABEL had protected that girl earlier,

00:21:09.744 --> 00:21:13.174
she might have ended up
as one of The Children.

00:21:26.994 --> 00:21:27.894
Hi.

00:21:27.894 --> 00:21:28.964
Major.

00:21:28.964 --> 00:21:31.084
So, how was the queen?

00:21:32.334 --> 00:21:35.004
Hmpf! Nothing special.

00:21:35.004 --> 00:21:37.934
If she's okay, then I could be queen, too.

00:21:38.374 --> 00:21:40.534
Even you aren't alone!

00:21:41.574 --> 00:21:42.974
I could...

00:21:43.044 --> 00:21:44.564
Yes.

00:21:44.914 --> 00:21:48.644
So leave that old building and join the rest of us.

00:21:49.384 --> 00:21:52.254
We'll even educate you, if you like.

00:21:52.254 --> 00:21:54.774
It's a little crowded, so you'll have to be patient.

00:21:57.924 --> 00:21:59.944
We did it! We have a new member!

00:22:00.894 --> 00:22:03.224
All right, shall we go?

00:22:10.774 --> 00:22:16.174
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:22:16.174 --> 00:22:16.504
Yeah

00:22:33.524 --> 00:22:36.824
Anata no mae jaa, hora

00:22:38.534 --> 00:22:44.064
ESP mo yaku ni tatanai no

00:22:44.404 --> 00:22:50.534
Pitagorasu de sae mo kaimei dekinai

00:22:50.914 --> 00:22:53.174
Koi wa chie no wa

00:22:55.414 --> 00:23:00.114
Naki sou na kao shite utsumuicha dame da yo

00:23:00.554 --> 00:23:05.424
Egao kara kiseki wa umareru da mon

00:23:06.094 --> 00:23:07.524
DA DA Daihon'mei

00:23:07.524 --> 00:23:07.824
Kyun kyun!

00:23:07.824 --> 00:23:08.824
Anata wo

00:23:08.824 --> 00:23:09.264
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.264 --> 00:23:12.994
Daitan futeki mono shitai

00:23:13.134 --> 00:23:17.134
Kanari tsubireru hodo maji na no zettai!

00:23:17.134 --> 00:23:18.574
DA DA Daihenshin

00:23:18.574 --> 00:23:18.874
Kyun kyun!

00:23:18.874 --> 00:23:19.874
Anata e

00:23:19.874 --> 00:23:20.474
Hai hai!

00:23:20.474 --> 00:23:25.304
Dainamaito na kuchidzuke wo ageru

00:23:25.444 --> 00:23:28.214
Suki na'tte hoshii no zettai!

00:23:28.214 --> 00:23:38.414
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:40.824
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.824 --> 00:23:42.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.964 --> 00:23:43.224
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.224 --> 00:23:45.424
That pregnant lady looks
worried about something.

00:23:45.494 --> 00:23:47.194
No, she's sad.

00:23:47.264 --> 00:23:50.834
Minamoto, isn't having a baby a happy thing?

00:23:50.834 --> 00:23:51.574
It is.

00:23:51.574 --> 00:23:54.094
Was my mom happy when she had me?

00:23:54.204 --> 00:23:54.934
Of course.

00:23:55.074 --> 00:23:56.064
Even though I'm an esper?

00:23:56.174 --> 00:23:58.264
Why do you ask? Of course she was happy.

00:23:58.414 --> 00:23:59.964
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:00.044 --> 00:24:03.244
Episode 25: "A Prayer for
Easy Birth! Hello, Baby!"

00:24:03.344 --> 00:24:04.984
I'm also glad that you girls were born.

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:05.884
A Prayer For Easy Birth!
Hello, Baby
I'm also glad that you girls were born.

00:24:05.884 --> 00:24:08.224
A Prayer For Easy Birth!
Hello, Baby
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.224 --> 00:24:09.954
A Prayer For Easy Birth!
Hello, Baby
